        "@value": "Niho, Fito, Y Marlin"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;High-energy Latin music and culture. Niho Takase: piano Fito Garcia: bass Marlin Ramazzini: vocals, percussion JUNO nominated pianist Niho Takase instantly fell in love with Cuban music when pianist Kathy Kidd introduced her to Latin music in college. Niho played in the Latin Jazz Ensemble led by renowned percussionist Sal Ferreras, later led by composer/trumpeter [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
