        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Bohemian rock music for the overworked and under-stimulated. Erik Severinson: guitar, vocals Eric Wettstein: guitar Markus Abramzik: bass Mark Kerrey: drums, electronics Whelming is a Vancouver music outfit developed for the purpose of exploring the creative capabilities of its members. With 20th century rock music as a jumping off point, the band lets their aesthetic [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
