        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A concert featuring the Sandy Scofield Band, Helene Duguay with the Murray Porter Band, and Dalannah Gail Bowen with Michael Creber Tickets in advance (sliding scale): $15, $20, $25 aunties_sing.eventbrite.ca Tickets at the door: pay what you can Host &amp; curator: Elaine Bomberry Here on the West Coast, there are a few legendary Indigenous female [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
